{
  "about": [
    "Deterministic DoH fixtures for scripts/dnssec-check.mjs.",
    "Synthetic, recorded BY HAND to the documented Cloudflare / Google DoH JSON",
    "shape — do not read them as a claim about any real zone. Zone names are",
    "reserved examples (example / example.com) precisely so nobody mistakes them",
    "for live state: a test must never depend on a domain being broken right now.",
    "Key format: <resolverId>|<zone>|<TYPE>[|cd] — resolverId is cloudflare or",
    "google, TYPE is DS or SOA, and the |cd suffix marks a checking-disabled query.",
    "Status is the DNS RCODE (0 NOERROR, 2 SERVFAIL); AD is whether the resolver",
    "authenticated the answer. See the source URLs cited in dnssec-check.mjs."
  ],
